    "body": "I think we want https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-time-origin even. I suspect this changed in High Resolution Time at some point, but it's rather hard to determine as git doesn't hold the generated HTML.\r\n\r\nA good way to fix this would be to make High Resolution Time export its definitions so we don't have to include a \"hard coded\" link.\r\n\r\ncc @igrigorik",
